        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Beast Rider is the first Golden Axe game in 3D as opposed to side scrolling hack and slash. While this is a major shift in game style from the previous games, Beast Rider maintains many of the elements from the originals such as magic and riding beasts, as well as sending the player on a quest to defeat Death Adder.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Beast Rider es el primer juego de Golden Axe en 3D, en lugar del hack and slash de desplazamiento lateral. Aunque supone un cambio importante de estilo respecto a los juegos anteriores, Beast Rider conserva muchos de sus elementos, como la magia y montar bestias, además de lanzar al jugador en una misión para derrotar a Death Adder.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
